\details{
The score is
\deqn{\hat S_c = \frac{\hat\sigma_\varepsilon^2 E_n[\hat\Pi_{c,i}^2] +
  n^{-1}\hat\sigma_{\varepsilon v}^2 (d_c^2 + d_c)}{\hat h_c^2}}{%
